# Copy to ~/.mbsyncrc and replace the placeholders.
# OAuth2 token command examples:
#   oama access isaac_nv@hotmail.es

Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

IMAPAccount hotmail
Host outlook.office365.com
Port 993
User isaac_nv@hotmail.es
PassCmd "oama access isaac_nv@hotmail.es"
AuthMechs XOAUTH2
TLSType IMAPS
Timeout 120

IMAPStore hotmail-remote
Account hotmail

MaildirStore hotmail-local
Path ~/Mail/hotmail/
Inbox ~/Mail/hotmail/Inbox
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel hotmail
Far :hotmail-remote:
Near :hotmail-local:
Patterns "INBOX" "Sent" "Drafts" "Archive" "Deleted Items"
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
